{"n":94,"ar":"الشرح","tr":"Ash-Sharh","en":"The Relief","type":"meccan","verses":[[1,"أَلَمۡ نَشۡرَحۡ لَكَ صَدۡرَكَ","Alam nashrah laka sadraka","Have We not caused thy bosom to dilate"],[2,"وَوَضَعۡنَا عَنكَ وِزۡرَكَ","WawadaAAna AAanka wizraka","And eased thee of the burden"],[3,"ٱلَّذِيٓ أَنقَضَ ظَهۡرَكَ","Allathee anqada thahraka","Which weighed down thy back"],[4,"وَرَفَعۡنَا لَكَ ذِكۡرَكَ","WarafaAAna laka thikraka","And exalted thy fame"],[5,"فَإِنَّ مَعَ ٱلۡعُسۡرِ يُسۡرًا","Fainna maAAa alAAusri yusran","But lo! with hardship goeth ease"],[6,"إِنَّ مَعَ ٱلۡعُسۡرِ يُسۡرٗا","Inna maAAa alAAusri yusran","Lo! with hardship goeth ease"],[7,"فَإِذَا فَرَغۡتَ فَٱنصَبۡ","Faitha faraghta fainsab","So when thou art relieved, still toil"],[8,"وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَٱرۡغَب","Waila rabbika fairghab","And strive to please thy Lord"]]}